1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,270
I am glad that the student union is collecting opinions on its work for the coming year.
我很高兴学生会正在就来年的工作征求意见。

2
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:16,740
Over the past year, it has organized many popular events, but there is still room to make student life richer and more meaningful.
过去一年里，学生会组织了许多受欢迎的活动，但学生生活仍有提升空间，可以变得更加丰富、更有意义。

3
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,930
Here are my suggestions.
以下是我的建议。

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:24,020
First, the union could offer activities that suit a wider range of interests.
第一，学生会可以开展适合更多兴趣爱好的活动。

5
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:35,150
Besides sports competitions and singing contests, it might organize book clubs, hiking trips and cooking classes, so that quieter students can also find something they enjoy.
除了体育比赛和歌唱比赛，它还可以组织读书会、徒步旅行和烹饪课，让性格比较安静的学生也能找到自己喜欢的活动。

6
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:46,670
Second, it could pay more attention to students’ practical needs, for example by inviting graduates to share their job-hunting experience or arranging short workshops on public speaking.
第二，学生会可以更加关注学生的实际需求，比如邀请毕业生分享求职经验，或者举办关于公众演讲的短期培训。

7
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:54,710
Third, the union could conduct a brief online survey after each event to learn what students liked and what could be improved.
第三，学生会可以在每次活动后开展一次简短的网上调查，了解学生喜欢什么、哪些方面还可以改进。

8
00:00:55,510 --> 00:01:06,460
If the student union listens carefully to students and keeps improving its work, campus life will become more varied and rewarding, and every student will feel more connected to the university.
如果学生会认真倾听学生的意见，不断改进工作，校园生活就会变得更加丰富多彩、更有收获，每个学生也会感到与学校联系更加紧密。

9
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:10,420
I look forward to taking part in its activities next year.
我期待明年参加学生会的活动。
